Public world library and craft
------------------------------
The maps in skins/neutral-planets3d/ are generated by the project's own procedural
baker (pure 3D noise), using fixed public seeds. No third-party art,
photography, folder identities or downloaded surface maps are used. The manifest
is grouped by folder kind, with a stable uid hash selecting a variant. The baker
is a development tool and is not distributed. These generated assets and the
original flat-hulled cargo skiff craft in skins/neutral-3d.json are covered by this
project's MIT license. The craft was authored as JSON geometry for this project.
